# The 55MB of models, WASM and fonts are NOT uploaded — `npm run setup` runs as
# part of the Vercel build command and reproduces them there. See vercel.json.
#
# Uploading them instead would work, but it sends 55MB over the wire on every
# deploy to rebuild something the build box can fetch in seconds.
public/models
public/wasm
public/fonts

node_modules
dist
.git
scratchpad
